<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Software/SoftwarePurpose/file> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Software/SoftwarePurpose> .
